        <desc id="map-desc">Ten municipality-level locations: three ArcelorMittal, five Gerdau, one Saint-Gobain, and one WestRock. Not exact tower locations.</desc>
        <g class="state-boundaries" aria-hidden="true"></g>
        <text class="map-status" x="130" y="145" text-anchor="middle">Loading state map…</text>
        <g class="pin" tabindex="0" role="img" aria-label="ArcelorMittal — Curvelo, Minas Gerais" style="--pin-color: #df6b6b">
          <title>ArcelorMittal — Curvelo, Minas Gerais</title>
